<p class="greeting">Employment Update</p>
<p class="intro">
  Hello {{firstName}}, this is to formally notify you that your employment
  with the organization has ended effective <strong>{{endDate}}</strong>.
</p>

<div class="info-card">
  <div class="info-row">
    <span class="info-label">Employee ID</span>
    <span class="info-value">{{employeeId}}</span>
  </div>
  <div class="info-row">
    <span class="info-label">Department</span>
    <span class="info-value">{{department}}</span>
  </div>
  <div class="info-row">
    <span class="info-label">Job Title</span>
    <span class="info-value">{{jobTitle}}</span>
  </div>
  <div class="info-row">
    <span class="info-label">Last Working Day</span>
    <span class="info-value">{{endDate}}</span>
  </div>
  <div class="info-row">
    <span class="info-label">Reason</span>
    <span class="info-value">{{reason}}</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="info">
  📋 Please ensure all company assets are returned and handover is completed.
  Your final payslip will be processed in the next payroll cycle.
</div>

<hr class="divider">

<p class="note">
  For any questions regarding your final settlement, please contact HR at
  <a href="mailto:hr@backoffice.ng" style="color:#3b82f6">hr@backoffice.ng</a>.
</p>